<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire June 2004 FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire June 2004 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BNL, BCI, Cariplo, Credito Italiano, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, IMI Lux, J.P. Morgan and San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE SPREAD     -30 BP    MATURITY    15.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE   S15.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.25    FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.95</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON FIXED AT 7.10 PCT</p>
<p>LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  30 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
